0:{"buildId":"vRbee8nUQznTUIaT_jJ-I","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"className":"relative mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-col gap-5 pt-24 md:gap-6","children":["$","section",null,{"id":"docs-content","className":"relative w-full overflow-hidden mx-auto max-w-6xl rounded-4xl bg-page-offset/90 shadow-panel px-6 py-8 sm:px-10 sm:py-10","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_20rem] lg:items-start","children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"min-w-0 wrap-break-word text-content-active","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-6 flex flex-wrap items-center","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"rounded-full bg-secondary text-content-inverse px-4 py-1","children":"Documentation"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-content","children":[["$","h1","h1-0",{"id":"catalog-ai-insights","children":"Catalog AI Insights"}],"\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"{: .no_toc }"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["<span class=\"label label-blue\">","{{ page.subcategory }}","</span>"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["The ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Catalog AI Insights"}]," plugin provides a conversational interface for Spotify Backstage to answer operational questions about any Software Catalog entity. By asking questions like ",["$","em","em-0",{"children":"\"Who is on call?\""}]," or ",["$","em","em-1",{"children":"\"Why did the last deployment fail?\""}],", developers receive real-time, cited answers grounded in live operational data."]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":["Instead of letting an LLM drive autonomous decision-making, the plugin relies on a ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"deterministic pipeline"}],": it programmatically routes intent, aggregates and redacts operational context, and uses the model strictly as a narrative synthesizer to author citation-backed responses - with automatic fallback to raw data if generation fails."]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"key-features","children":"Key Features"}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Deterministic Intent Routing"}],": Classifies queries via pattern matching into four fixed tool plans (",["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"ownership-oncall"}]}],", ",["$","pre","code-1",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"observability-links"}]}],", ",["$","pre","code-2",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"deployment-health"}]}],", ",["$","pre","code-3",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"general-context"}]}],") without model-driven tool selection."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Entity-Scoped RAG"}],": Restricts retrieval chunks strictly to the target entity (",["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"knowledge.retrieve"}]}]," with ",["$","pre","code-1",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"entityFilter"}]}]," and configurable limits)."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Automated Data Redaction"}],": Automatically sanitizes context items before prompting, stripping bearer tokens, AWS keys, PEM blocks, and credential pairs."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Deterministic Fallbacks"}],": Renders gathered context into cited answer blocks if the model fails validation, outputs invalid JSON, or leaves claims uncited."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Multi-Turn Session Memory"}],": Uses a persistent ",["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"sessionId"}]}]," to chain follow-up questions within the active entity context."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-5",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Proactive Nightly Scans"}],": Automatically runs bounded deployment-health probes across Kubernetes-annotated components, saving them as replayable AI Core runs."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-6",{"children":["$L2",": Offers an Entity Page card with one-click canned prompts and a free-form dialog, alongside a deep-linkable ","$L3"," view."]}],"\n"]}],"\n","$L4","\n","$L5","\n","$L6","\n","$L7","\n","$L8","\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f","\n","$L40","\n","$L41","\n","$L42","\n","$L43","\n","$L44","\n","$L45","\n","$L46","\n","$L47","\n","$L48","\n","$L49","\n","$L4a","\n","$L4b","\n","$L4c","\n","$L4d","\n","$L4e","\n","$L4f","\n","$L50","\n","$L51","\n","$L52","\n","$L53","\n","$L54","\n","$L55","\n","$L56","\n","$L57","\n","$L58","\n","$L59","\n","$L5a","\n","$L5b","\n","$L5c","\n","$L5d","\n","$L5e","\n","$L5f","\n","$L60","\n","$L61","\n","$L62","\n","$L63","\n","$L64","\n","$L65","\n","$L66","\n","$L67","\n","$L68","\n","$L69","\n","$L6a","\n","$L6b","\n","$L6c","\n","$L6d","\n","$L6e","\n","$L6f","\n","$L70","\n","$L71","\n","$L72","\n","$L73","\n","$L74","\n","$L75","\n","$L76","\n","$L77","\n","$L78","\n","$L79","\n","$L7a","\n","$L7b","\n","$L7c","\n","$L7d","\n","$L7e","\n","$L7f","\n","$L80","\n","$L81","\n","$L82","\n","$L83","\n","$L84","\n","$L85","\n","$L86","\n","$L87","\n","$L88","\n","$L89","\n","$L8a","\n","$L8b","\n","$L8c","\n","$L8d","\n","$L8e","\n","$L8f","\n","$L90","\n","$L91","\n","$L92","\n","$L93","\n","$L94","\n","$L95","\n","$L96","\n","$L97"]}]]}],"$L98"]}]}]}],null,"$L99"]}],"isPartial":"$@9a","staleTime":"$9b