7:["$","p","p-5",{"children":["The graph runs through seven deterministic nodes: ",["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"request.validate → intent.classify → entity.resolve → context.gather → context.normalize → insight.synthesize → insight.finalize"}]}],". The artifact kind is ",["$","pre","code-1",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"catalog-insight-report"}]}],". The agent's memory mode is ",["$","pre","code-2",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"session"}]}],", enabling conversational follow-up across multiple questions about the same entity."]}]
