2f:["$","ul","ul-3",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Question trigger"}]," — any Backstage user with access to the ",["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"catalog-ai-insights"}]}]," plugin can submit a question via ",["$","pre","code-1",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"POST agents/catalog-ai-insights/runs"}]}]]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Catalog entity access"}]," — the module resolves the target entity through the catalog backend using a plugin-to-plugin auth token; if the entity does not exist or is not visible to the backend service identity, the run terminates at ",["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"entity.resolve"}]}]]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Nightly scan dispatch"}]," — the scheduler service principal holds plugin-to-plugin auth tokens via ",["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"auth.getPluginRequestToken"}]}]," targeting ",["$","pre","code-1",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"ai-core"}]}],"; scans only dispatch runs, they never invoke the graph in-process"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"No per-intent RBAC"}]," is defined yet; all four intent classes are available to any authenticated user"]}],"\n"]}]
