63:["$","p","p-35",{"children":["After a run completes, the ",["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"sessionId"}]}]," is preserved. Subsequent questions about the same entity automatically include the session ID, allowing the model to reference earlier answers. The ",["$","pre","code-1",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"InsightStatusBanner"}]}]," indicates whether a follow-up is in progress."]}]
